<title>LATVIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES - APRIL 30.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES - APRIL 30.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the main headlines on Latvian state radio at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and does not vouch for their accuracy:</p>
<p>- A law on preventing money laundering was approved by a parliament committee</p>
<p>- President Guntis Ulmanis is wrapping up his visit to Poland</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
